guide acceptance-good/farms
title The Westfall Farms
faction Alliance
levels 10-12
zone Westfall
author Ann Example

step Sentinel Hill
  tip The tower at the crossroads in the middle of Westfall.
  goto 56.3,47.5 "Sentinel Hill" r 30

step The Molsen Farm
  tip North of Sentinel Hill, past the road to the Jangolode Mine.
  goto 45.2,35.4 "The Molsen Farm" r 30
